          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "and we also can't really close it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "because that's now the logic we'll add together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 79.14,
          "en": "with help of Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.14,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "And let's start with making sure that we can close it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "for example, by clicking on the backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "or by clicking this cancel button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "And the idea is to essentially emit an event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "from inside this new-task.component when this backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 100.59,
          "en": "or this Cancel button here is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.59,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "a cancel event let's say, which can then be handled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 108.6,
          "en": "by the tasks.component, which is the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "that is rendering this new-task.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "So that we set, this isAddingTask property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "in that tasks.component back to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 123.09,
          "en": "which it also is initially if we clicked on Cancel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.09,
          "end": 124.203,
          "en": "or the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 127.17,
          "en": "Now again, this is definitely something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.17,
          "end": 129.99,
          "en": "you can try implementing on your own first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.99,
          "end": 132.09,
          "en": "because you will only need knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 134.04,
          "en": "you already gained thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.04,
          "end": 136.23,
          "en": "But after a short pause, which you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 139.353,
          "en": "to pause the video, we'll implement it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.26,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "So to make this dialog closeable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "I will start here in the tasks.component TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "by adding another new method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.43,
          "end": 155.31,
          "en": "Maybe here at the bottom, though the exact position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.31,
          "end": 159.317,
          "en": "doesn't matter, and I'll name it onCancelAddTask.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.664,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "That sounds like a fitting name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 166.96,
          "en": "because it should be invoked when we cancel this process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 171.543,
          "en": "and in there, we can set isAddingTask to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.65,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "which because of the code in its template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 180.63,
          "en": "we'll then remove this new-task.component from the DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "because this is only rendered conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 186.993,
          "en": "with help of @if if isAddingTask is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 190.08,
          "en": "If isAddingTask is set to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.08,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "it will therefore be removed by Angular automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 195.39,
          "en": "because of how Angular works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 198.663,
          "en": "and because of our declarative template code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.98,
          "end": 202.23,
          "en": "So therefore now, we, of course, must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.23,
          "end": 205.17000000000002,
          "en": "that we do invoke onCancelAddTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "if the dialog is closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "And therefore, we should go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "to the new-task.component.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "which is responsible for rendering that dialog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.01,
          "end": 219.21,
          "en": "And we should add click listeners here on that backdrop div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 219.21,
          "end": 222.69,
          "en": "so that clicking the backdrop will close the dialog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.69,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "and on this Cancel button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 227.07,
          "en": "By the way, it's important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.07,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "that this button here is of type=\"button,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 233.94,
          "en": "not because of Angular, but because of how the web works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.94,
          "end": 236.07,
          "en": "because of it would be of type Submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.07,
